# Allow-list repository.
#
# Everything is ignored by default and the tracked files are opted back
# in below. This is deliberate: the working folder also holds hundreds of
# megabytes of capture images, training runs and logs, plus older v1/v2
# scripts, and none of that belongs in the repo. Adding a new source file
# means adding a "!" line for it here.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt

# --- the pick application ---
!vision_pick3.py
!vision3.py
!vision_common.py
!detect_cube.py
!camera_test.py

# --- one-time setup / teaching tools ---
!auto_calibrate3.py
!teach_floor.py
!teach_place.py
!gripper_reset.py

# --- training the cube detector ---
!capture_dataset.py
!train_cubes.py
!audit_dataset.py
!cube_model.pt

# --- reference config for this cell (see README) ---
!calib3.json
!grip_ref.json
!floor_ref.json

# --- launchers ---
!launchers/
!launchers/*.bat
